  apexo debug lsp           LSP debugging utilities
  apexo debug rg            ripgrep debugging utilities
  apexo debug file          file system debugging utilities
  apexo debug scrap         list all known projects
  apexo debug skill         list all available skills
  apexo debug snapshot      snapshot debugging utilities
  apexo debug startup       print startup timing
  apexo debug agent <name>  show agent configuration details
  apexo debug v2            debug v2 catalog and built-in plugins
  apexo debug info          show debug information
  apexo debug paths         show global paths (data, config, cache, state)
  apexo debug wait          wait indefinitely (for debugging)

